      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67502f34393bb3d81bc274a2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有一张明信片掉到地板上，\n上面的文字碰巧映入了我眼帘。\n明信片上写着……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec4790d682f35286dd7424142a35b0a884a4e6b7f196f243d1a5e86927e5db07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036507.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a0a3d410be815af555af92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“当我为了工作烦恼时，你拼命奔跑、\n不愿放弃的模样给了我勇气，所以……\n我不会说希望你加油。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0aa0ea391fb4985f827a821c55698c2de2d681c3b9c5171384e63315892b527",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036507.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b64cc402a9d86ef5aaeafd23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“而是有一个人会为你加油。\n我希望你知道这一点，所以才寄出这封信。\n我支持你。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbe4c884ae037bd7d9811ba5aabbc7bdfbfd0ec0b4eb13b38d80feb3f8ae9773",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1036/storytimeline_501036507.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebfaf3f9b588486757f5a57d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的训练也一起加油吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c50954329647bec342253233f6c701c573ac2f14ec39f3d65b05c172452465e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
